```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner activation --help
Manage runner enrollment activations

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner activation [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create a single-use runner activation
  list    List runner activations
  revoke  Revoke a runner activation
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
